<title>NEPAL: Nepali rupee quoted at 57.00/05 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Nepali rupee quoted at 57.00/05 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>KATHMANDU 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nepali rupee was quoted on Thursday in a trading range of 57.00/05 by the 10 commercial banks active in the local forex market.</p>
<p>The trading range was 57.00-57.03 on Tuesday</p>
<p>Nepal Rastra Bank, the kingdom's central bank, posted a rupee-dollar rate of 56.75/7.30 for its own transactions, unchanged from Wednesday.</p>
</text>
